Professional summary: adapt it to the job, mention at least one concrete offer anchor, max {{ max_summary_lines }} lines and max {{ max_summary_length }} characters. Use only summary_source, experiences, projects and allowed_skills. When using evidence from an ongoing or self_reported project, qualify it explicitly as ongoing/current work or omit it; avoid broad claims like "3D research settings", "experience across 3D research", or "expertise in 3D medical AI" unless verified by stronger evidence. Keep the opening role consistent with cv_title; for example, do not write "Data Scientist with..." under an "AI Engineer" title.
